<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Proof of Proposition (VPSG token guidance)</h2>

<section id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Setup.</h5>

<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Let <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{V}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{V}</annotation></semantics></math> be the vocabulary and <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}\subset\mathcal{V}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mo>⊂</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}\subset\mathcal{V}</annotation></semantics></math> the digit subset.
At decoding step <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>, denote by <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{A}(v\mid c_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{A}(v\mid c_{t})</annotation></semantics></math> the position-conditioned (main-route) distribution and by <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{B}(v)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{B}(v)</annotation></semantics></math> the position-<em id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">un</em>conditioned reference obtained from PE-shuffled auxiliary routes.
Write <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell_{A}(v\mid c_{t})=\log p_{A}(v\mid c_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell_{A}(v\mid c_{t})=\log p_{A}(v\mid c_{t})</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{\ell}_{B}(v)=\log p_{B}(v)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>B</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{\ell}_{B}(v)=\log p_{B}(v)</annotation></semantics></math>.
We assume:
(i) the same logits processors are applied to both routes before any guidance;
(ii) guidance acts only at the final-layer logits; and
(iii) decoding is greedy, i.e., depends on the <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\arg\max" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>max</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\arg\max</annotation></semantics></math> over logits.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">CFG form.</h5>

<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Consider the (digit-only) classifier-free guidance (CFG) mixing:</p>
<table id="A1.E5" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\mathrm{CFG}}(v\mid c_{t})\;\propto\;\begin{cases}\dfrac{p_{A}(v\mid c_{t})^{\,1+\lambda_{t}}}{p_{B}(v)^{\,\lambda_{t}}},&amp;v\in\mathcal{D},\\[6.0pt]
p_{A}(v\mid c_{t}),&amp;v\notin\mathcal{D},\end{cases}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>CFG</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.280em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.558em">∝</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn> 1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∉</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\mathrm{CFG}}(v\mid c_{t})\;\propto\;\begin{cases}\dfrac{p_{A}(v\mid c_{t})^{\,1+\lambda_{t}}}{p_{B}(v)^{\,\lambda_{t}}},&amp;v\in\mathcal{D},\\[6.0pt]
p_{A}(v\mid c_{t}),&amp;v\notin\mathcal{D},\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(5)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2" class="ltx_p">with normalization constant <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z_{\mathrm{CFG}}(c_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>CFG</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{\mathrm{CFG}}(c_{t})</annotation></semantics></math> implicit over <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v\in\mathcal{V}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v\in\mathcal{V}</annotation></semantics></math>.
Taking logs for <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v\in\mathcal{D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v\in\mathcal{D}</annotation></semantics></math>,</p>
<table id="A1.E6" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\log p_{\mathrm{CFG}}(v\mid c_{t})=(1+\lambda_{t})\,\ell_{A}(v\mid c_{t})-\lambda_{t}\,\tilde{\ell}_{B}(v)-\log Z_{\mathrm{CFG}}(c_{t})." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>CFG</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>B</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>CFG</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\log p_{\mathrm{CFG}}(v\mid c_{t})=(1+\lambda_{t})\,\ell_{A}(v\mid c_{t})-\lambda_{t}\,\tilde{\ell}_{B}(v)-\log Z_{\mathrm{CFG}}(c_{t}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(6)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Digit-only positive affine rescaling.</h5>

<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Define, for <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v\in\mathcal{D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v\in\mathcal{D}</annotation></semantics></math>,</p>
<table id="A1.E7" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\psi_{t}(v)\;=\;\frac{1}{1+\lambda_{t}}\Big(\log p_{\mathrm{CFG}}(v\mid c_{t})+\log Z_{\mathrm{CFG}}(c_{t})\Big)\;=\;\ell_{A}(v\mid c_{t})\;-\;\underbrace{\frac{\lambda_{t}}{1+\lambda_{t}}}_{\alpha_{t}}\,\tilde{\ell}_{B}(v)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo rspace="0.280em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>CFG</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>CFG</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" rspace="0.280em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.280em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.502em">−</mo><mrow><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mfrac><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></munder><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>B</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\psi_{t}(v)\;=\;\frac{1}{1+\lambda_{t}}\Big(\log p_{\mathrm{CFG}}(v\mid c_{t})+\log Z_{\mathrm{CFG}}(c_{t})\Big)\;=\;\ell_{A}(v\mid c_{t})\;-\;\underbrace{\frac{\lambda_{t}}{1+\lambda_{t}}}_{\alpha_{t}}\,\tilde{\ell}_{B}(v).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(7)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2" class="ltx_p">For <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v\notin\mathcal{D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∉</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v\notin\mathcal{D}</annotation></semantics></math>, keep <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\psi_{t}(v)=\log p_{A}(v\mid c_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\psi_{t}(v)=\log p_{A}(v\mid c_{t})</annotation></semantics></math> (no change).</p>
</div>
<div id="Thmlemma1" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlemma1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 1</span></span><span id="Thmlemma1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(Argmax invariance under positive affine transforms)<span id="Thmlemma1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlemma1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmlemma1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Let <math id="Thmlemma1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S\subseteq\mathcal{V}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S\subseteq\mathcal{V}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Thmlemma1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="Thmlemma1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b\in\mathbb{R}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℝ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b\in\mathbb{R}</annotation></semantics></math>.
For any scores <math id="Thmlemma1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{u(v)\}_{v\in S}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{u(v)\}_{v\in S}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="Thmlemma1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\arg\max_{v\in S}u(v)=\arg\max_{v\in S}\{a\,u(v)+b\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><msub><mi>max</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>max</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\arg\max_{v\in S}u(v)=\arg\max_{v\in S}\{a\,u(v)+b\}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.1" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">For <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u(v_{1})\geq u(v_{2})\iff a\,u(v_{1})+b\geq a\,u(v_{2})+b" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⇔</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u(v_{1})\geq u(v_{2})\iff a\,u(v_{1})+b\geq a\,u(v_{2})+b</annotation></semantics></math>.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Applying the lemma to equation <a href="#A1.E6" title="Equation 6 ‣ CFG form. ‣ Appendix A Proof of Proposition (VPSG token guidance) ‣ Mitigating Coordinate Prediction Bias from Positional Encoding Failures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> with <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a=\tfrac{1}{1+\lambda_{t}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a=\tfrac{1}{1+\lambda_{t}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b=\tfrac{\log Z_{\mathrm{CFG}}(c_{t})}{1+\lambda_{t}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>CFG</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b=\tfrac{\log Z_{\mathrm{CFG}}(c_{t})}{1+\lambda_{t}}</annotation></semantics></math> <em id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">restricted to <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v\in\mathcal{D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v\in\mathcal{D}</annotation></semantics></math></em> shows that</p>
<table id="A1.Ex1" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\arg\max_{v\in\mathcal{D}}\log p_{\mathrm{CFG}}(v\mid c_{t})\;=\;\arg\max_{v\in\mathcal{D}}\psi_{t}(v)\;=\;\arg\max_{v\in\mathcal{D}}\big(\ell_{A}(v\mid c_{t})-\alpha_{t}\,\tilde{\ell}_{B}(v)\big)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></mrow></munder><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>CFG</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.280em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></mrow></munder></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo rspace="0.280em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></mrow></munder><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>B</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\arg\max_{v\in\mathcal{D}}\log p_{\mathrm{CFG}}(v\mid c_{t})\;=\;\arg\max_{v\in\mathcal{D}}\psi_{t}(v)\;=\;\arg\max_{v\in\mathcal{D}}\big(\ell_{A}(v\mid c_{t})-\alpha_{t}\,\tilde{\ell}_{B}(v)\big).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3.2" class="ltx_p">Since <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\mathrm{CFG}}(v\mid c_{t})=p_{A}(v\mid c_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>CFG</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\mathrm{CFG}}(v\mid c_{t})=p_{A}(v\mid c_{t})</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v\notin\mathcal{D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∉</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v\notin\mathcal{D}</annotation></semantics></math> by equation <a href="#A1.E5" title="Equation 5 ‣ CFG form. ‣ Appendix A Proof of Proposition (VPSG token guidance) ‣ Mitigating Coordinate Prediction Bias from Positional Encoding Failures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>, the combined (digit/non-digit) <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\arg\max" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>max</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\arg\max</annotation></semantics></math> under CFG equals that under the piecewise score</p>
<table id="A1.Ex2" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s(v)\;=\;\begin{cases}\ell_{A}(v\mid c_{t})-\alpha_{t}\,\tilde{\ell}_{B}(v),&amp;v\in\mathcal{D},\\[3.0pt]
\ell_{A}(v\mid c_{t}),&amp;v\notin\mathcal{D},\end{cases}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo rspace="0.280em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>B</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∉</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s(v)\;=\;\begin{cases}\ell_{A}(v\mid c_{t})-\alpha_{t}\,\tilde{\ell}_{B}(v),&amp;v\in\mathcal{D},\\[3.0pt]
\ell_{A}(v\mid c_{t}),&amp;v\notin\mathcal{D},\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3.3" class="ltx_p">which is the VPSG “negative-evidence” scoring form.
Moreover, equation <a href="#A1.E7" title="Equation 7 ‣ Digit-only positive affine rescaling. ‣ Appendix A Proof of Proposition (VPSG token guidance) ‣ Mitigating Coordinate Prediction Bias from Positional Encoding Failures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> yields the exact parameter mapping</p>
<table id="A1.Ex3" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex3.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\boxed{\quad\alpha_{t}=\dfrac{\lambda_{t}}{1+\lambda_{t}}\quad}\qquad\Longleftrightarrow\qquad\boxed{\quad\lambda_{t}=\dfrac{\alpha_{t}}{1-\alpha_{t}}\quad}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><menclose notation="box"><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mspace style="width:1em;" width="1em"></mspace></mrow></menclose><mo stretchy="false">⟺</mo><menclose notation="box"><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mspace style="width:1em;" width="1em"></mspace></mrow></menclose><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{\quad\alpha_{t}=\dfrac{\lambda_{t}}{1+\lambda_{t}}\quad}\qquad\Longleftrightarrow\qquad\boxed{\quad\lambda_{t}=\dfrac{\alpha_{t}}{1-\alpha_{t}}\quad}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Equivalence under greedy decoding.</h5>

<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Greedy decoding selects <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{v}_{t}=\arg\max_{v\in\mathcal{V}}\log p_{\mathrm{CFG}}(v\mid c_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>v</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><msub><mi>max</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>CFG</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{v}_{t}=\arg\max_{v\in\mathcal{V}}\log p_{\mathrm{CFG}}(v\mid c_{t})</annotation></semantics></math>.
By the lemma and the piecewise definition above, the same <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{v}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>v</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{v}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> is obtained by maximizing <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s(v)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s(v)</annotation></semantics></math>, because:
(i) on digits we used a positive affine transform of <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\log p_{\mathrm{CFG}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>CFG</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\log p_{\mathrm{CFG}}</annotation></semantics></math>;
(ii) on non-digits the two forms coincide; and
(iii) both are compared in the same joint candidate set <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{V}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{V}</annotation></semantics></math>.
Therefore CFG equation <a href="#A1.E5" title="Equation 5 ‣ CFG form. ‣ Appendix A Proof of Proposition (VPSG token guidance) ‣ Mitigating Coordinate Prediction Bias from Positional Encoding Failures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> and VPSG scoring <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s(v)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s(v)</annotation></semantics></math> are <em id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">decision-equivalent</em> under greedy decoding.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px5" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Normalization and distributional form.</h5>

<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">If a normalized distribution is desired, define</p>
<table id="A1.Ex4" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\mathrm{VPSG}}(v\mid c_{t})\;=\;\frac{\exp(s(v))}{\sum_{u\in\mathcal{V}}\exp(s(u))}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>VPSG</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.280em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\mathrm{VPSG}}(v\mid c_{t})\;=\;\frac{\exp(s(v))}{\sum_{u\in\mathcal{V}}\exp(s(u))}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px5.p1.2" class="ltx_p">This coincides with equation <a href="#A1.E5" title="Equation 5 ‣ CFG form. ‣ Appendix A Proof of Proposition (VPSG token guidance) ‣ Mitigating Coordinate Prediction Bias from Positional Encoding Failures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> up to the digit-only affine rescaling leading to the same <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\arg\max" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>max</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\arg\max</annotation></semantics></math>, and yields the proposition’s statement:</p>
<table id="A1.Ex5" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\mathrm{VPSG}}(v\mid c_{t})\propto\begin{cases}\exp\!\big(\ell_{A}(v\mid c_{t})-\alpha_{t}\,\tilde{\ell}_{B}(v)\big),&amp;v\in\mathcal{D},\\[3.0pt]
p_{A}(v\mid c_{t}),&amp;v\notin\mathcal{D}.\end{cases}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>VPSG</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∝</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mpadded style="width:1.370em;" width="1.370em"><mi>exp</mi></mpadded><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>B</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∉</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\mathrm{VPSG}}(v\mid c_{t})\propto\begin{cases}\exp\!\big(\ell_{A}(v\mid c_{t})-\alpha_{t}\,\tilde{\ell}_{B}(v)\big),&amp;v\in\mathcal{D},\\[3.0pt]
p_{A}(v\mid c_{t}),&amp;v\notin\mathcal{D}.\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px6" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Remarks on assumptions.</h5>

<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px6.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">(1) <em id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Same logits processors:</em> ensures that when <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px6.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{t}\to 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{t}\to 0</annotation></semantics></math> (or <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px6.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda_{t}\to 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda_{t}\to 0</annotation></semantics></math>) the VPSG rule recovers the baseline exactly.
(2) <em id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px6.p1.1.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Final-layer intervention:</em> guarantees that the affine transformation does not change any upstream normalization.
(3) <em id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px6.p1.1.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Greedy decoding:</em> makes decision-equivalence depend only on <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px6.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\arg\max" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>max</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\arg\max</annotation></semantics></math>; for sampling or beam search, the same mapping holds at the score level, but selection statistics may also depend on temperature/length penalties (which can still be shared across routes).</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px6.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px6.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px6.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\square" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">□</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\square</annotation></semantics></math></p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Algorithm of VPSG</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The complete algorithm is shown in <a href="#alg1" title="In Appendix B Algorithm of VPSG ‣ Mitigating Coordinate Prediction Bias from Positional Encoding Failures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Algorithm</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> Vision-PE Shuffle Guidance (VPSG)</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1:</span>
            
            
          Image <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="I" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>I</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I</annotation></semantics></math>, prompt <math id="alg1.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q</annotation></semantics></math>, base model <math id="alg1.l1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}</annotation></semantics></math>, seeds <math id="alg1.l1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{s_{1},\dots,s_{S}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{s_{1},\dots,s_{S}\}</annotation></semantics></math>, base coefficient <math id="alg1.l1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math>, decay factor <math id="alg1.l1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0&lt;\mathrm{decay}&lt;1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>decay</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0&lt;\mathrm{decay}&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2:</span>
            
            
          Coordinate prediction <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{y}=[x,y]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{y}=[x,y]</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Main route (position-conditioned):</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">4:</span>
            
            
          Run <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}</annotation></semantics></math> on <math id="alg1.l4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(I,q)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(I,q)</annotation></semantics></math> with normal positional encodings (PEs) to obtain token distribution <math id="alg1.l4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{A}(v\mid c_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{A}(v\mid c_{t})</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">5:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Auxiliary routes (position-unconditioned):</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">6:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each seed <math id="alg1.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>s</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">7:</span>
            
            
            Shuffle PEs and run <math id="alg1.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}</annotation></semantics></math> to get <math id="alg1.l7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{B}^{(s)}(v)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>B</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{B}^{(s)}(v)</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">8:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">9:</span>
            
            
          Aggregate in log-space:

<table id="A2.Ex6" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{\ell}_{B}(v)\leftarrow\frac{1}{S}\sum_{s=1}^{S}\log p_{B}^{(s)}(v)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>B</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>S</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>S</mi></munderover><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>B</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{\ell}_{B}(v)\leftarrow\frac{1}{S}\sum_{s=1}^{S}\log p_{B}^{(s)}(v).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">10:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l10.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">FSM state tracking:</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">11:</span>
            
            
          Use a finite-state machine aligned to the <math id="alg1.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[x,y]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[x,y]</annotation></semantics></math> template to determine whether the model is decoding a digit in <math id="alg1.l11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math> or <math id="alg1.l11.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>y</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">12:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l12.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Coefficient scheduling:</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">13:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l13.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> decoding the <math id="alg1.l13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k_{x}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k_{x}</annotation></semantics></math>-th digit of <math id="alg1.l13.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l13.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">14:</span>
            
            
            <math id="alg1.l14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{t}\leftarrow\alpha\cdot\mathrm{decay}^{\,k_{x}-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msup><mi>decay</mi><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{t}\leftarrow\alpha\cdot\mathrm{decay}^{\,k_{x}-1}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">15:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l15.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">else</span> <span id="alg1.l15.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> decoding the first digit of <math id="alg1.l15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>y</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l15.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">16:</span>
            
            
            <math id="alg1.l16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{t}\leftarrow\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{t}\leftarrow\alpha</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l17" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">17:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l17.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">else</span> <span id="alg1.l17.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> decoding the <math id="alg1.l17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k_{y}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k_{y}</annotation></semantics></math>-th digit of <math id="alg1.l17.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>y</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l17.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l18" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">18:</span>
            
            
            <math id="alg1.l18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{t}\leftarrow\alpha\cdot\mathrm{decay}^{\,k_{y}-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msup><mi>decay</mi><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{t}\leftarrow\alpha\cdot\mathrm{decay}^{\,k_{y}-1}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l19" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">19:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l19.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l19.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l20" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">20:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l20.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Negative-evidence scoring:</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l21" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">21:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l21.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each token <math id="alg1.l21.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>v</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l21.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l22" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">22:</span>
            
            
            
<table id="A2.Ex7" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s(v)\leftarrow\begin{cases}\log p_{A}(v\mid c_{t})-\alpha_{t}\tilde{\ell}_{B}(v),&amp;v\in\mathcal{D},\\[4.0pt]
\log p_{A}(v\mid c_{t}),&amp;v\notin\mathcal{D}.\end{cases}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>B</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∉</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s(v)\leftarrow\begin{cases}\log p_{A}(v\mid c_{t})-\alpha_{t}\tilde{\ell}_{B}(v),&amp;v\in\mathcal{D},\\[4.0pt]
\log p_{A}(v\mid c_{t}),&amp;v\notin\mathcal{D}.\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l23" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">23:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l23.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l23.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l24" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">24:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l24.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Token selection:</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l25" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">25:</span>
            
            
          Choose <math id="alg1.l25.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{v}_{t}\leftarrow\arg\max_{v}s(v)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>v</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><msub><mi>max</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{v}_{t}\leftarrow\arg\max_{v}s(v)</annotation></semantics></math>, append to output, and advance FSM.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l26" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">26:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l26.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Termination:</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l27" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">27:</span>
            
            
          Repeat Steps 3–6 until EOS. Decode tokens into coordinates <math id="alg1.l27.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{y}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{y}</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
</div>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Expected distance in the unit square</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Claim. If <math id="A3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="X=(X_{1},X_{2})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X=(X_{1},X_{2})</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Y=(Y_{1},Y_{2})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Y=(Y_{1},Y_{2})</annotation></semantics></math> are independent and uniformly distributed on <math id="A3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[0,1]^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[0,1]^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>, then</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A3.Ex8" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{E}\big[\|X-Y\|_{2}\big]=\frac{2+\sqrt{2}+5\ln(1+\sqrt{2})}{15}\;\approx\;0.521405433." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>Y</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0.558em">≈</mo><mn> 0.521405433</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}\big[\|X-Y\|_{2}\big]=\frac{2+\sqrt{2}+5\ln(1+\sqrt{2})}{15}\;\approx\;0.521405433.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Proof. Let</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A3.Ex9" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U=\lvert X_{1}-Y_{1}\rvert,\qquad V=\lvert X_{2}-Y_{2}\rvert." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U=\lvert X_{1}-Y_{1}\rvert,\qquad V=\lvert X_{2}-Y_{2}\rvert.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p5.1" class="ltx_p">For <math id="A3.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u,v\in[0,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u,v\in[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math>, the joint density of <math id="A3.p5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(U,V)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(U,V)</annotation></semantics></math> is</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A3.Ex10" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f_{U,V}(u,v)=4(1-u)(1-v)," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_{U,V}(u,v)=4(1-u)(1-v),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p7.1" class="ltx_p">since each marginal <math id="A3.p7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>U</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U</annotation></semantics></math> (and <math id="A3.p7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>V</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V</annotation></semantics></math>) is triangular with density <math id="A3.p7.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f_{U}(u)=2(1-u)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>U</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_{U}(u)=2(1-u)</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.p7.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U,V" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U,V</annotation></semantics></math> are independent. The Euclidean distance is <math id="A3.p7.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R=\sqrt{U^{2}+V^{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>U</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R=\sqrt{U^{2}+V^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math>. Hence</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.p8" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A3.Ex11" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{E}[R]=\int_{0}^{1}\!\!\int_{0}^{1}\sqrt{u^{2}+v^{2}}\,4(1-u)(1-v)\,du\,dv." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo rspace="0em">∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn> 4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}[R]=\int_{0}^{1}\!\!\int_{0}^{1}\sqrt{u^{2}+v^{2}}\,4(1-u)(1-v)\,du\,dv.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p9" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p9.1" class="ltx_p">Switch to polar coordinates on the first quadrant: <math id="A3.p9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u=r\cos\theta,\;v=r\sin\theta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.447em">,</mo><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u=r\cos\theta,\;v=r\sin\theta</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A3.p9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta\in[0,\pi/2]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta\in[0,\pi/2]</annotation></semantics></math> and Jacobian <math id="A3.p9.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r\,dr\,d\theta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r\,dr\,d\theta</annotation></semantics></math>. The square boundary imposes</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.p10" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A3.Ex12" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0\leq r\leq r_{\max}(\theta)=\min\{1/\cos\theta,\;1/\sin\theta\}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn> 1</mn><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0\leq r\leq r_{\max}(\theta)=\min\{1/\cos\theta,\;1/\sin\theta\}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p11" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p11.1" class="ltx_p">Noting <math id="A3.p11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sqrt{u^{2}+v^{2}}=r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sqrt{u^{2}+v^{2}}=r</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.p11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(1-u)(1-v)=(1-r\cos\theta)(1-r\sin\theta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(1-u)(1-v)=(1-r\cos\theta)(1-r\sin\theta)</annotation></semantics></math>, we obtain</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.p12" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A3.Ex13" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{E}[R]=4\!\int_{0}^{\pi/2}\!\!\int_{0}^{r_{\max}(\theta)}(1-r\cos\theta)(1-r\sin\theta)\,r^{2}\,dr\,d\theta." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.0539em">=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo lspace="0.0539em" rspace="0em">∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><msubsup><mo rspace="0em">∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}[R]=4\!\int_{0}^{\pi/2}\!\!\int_{0}^{r_{\max}(\theta)}(1-r\cos\theta)(1-r\sin\theta)\,r^{2}\,dr\,d\theta.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p13" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p13.1" class="ltx_p">Split at <math id="A3.p13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta=\pi/4" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta=\pi/4</annotation></semantics></math>, where <math id="A3.p13.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{\max}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{\max}</annotation></semantics></math> changes:</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.p14" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A3.Ex14" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{E}[R]=4\!\int_{0}^{\pi/4}\!\!\int_{0}^{\sec\theta}(1-r\cos\theta)(1-r\sin\theta)\,r^{2}\,dr\,d\theta+4\!\int_{\pi/4}^{\pi/2}\!\!\int_{0}^{\csc\theta}(1-r\cos\theta)(1-r\sin\theta)\,r^{2}\,dr\,d\theta." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.0539em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo lspace="0.0539em" rspace="0em">∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><msubsup><mo rspace="0em">∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>sec</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.026em">+</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo lspace="0.026em" rspace="0em">∫</mo><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><msubsup><mo rspace="0em">∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>csc</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}[R]=4\!\int_{0}^{\pi/4}\!\!\int_{0}^{\sec\theta}(1-r\cos\theta)(1-r\sin\theta)\,r^{2}\,dr\,d\theta+4\!\int_{\pi/4}^{\pi/2}\!\!\int_{0}^{\csc\theta}(1-r\cos\theta)(1-r\sin\theta)\,r^{2}\,dr\,d\theta.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p15" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p15.1" class="ltx_p">For fixed <math id="A3.p15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>θ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta</annotation></semantics></math>, expand and integrate in <math id="A3.p15.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math>:</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.p16" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A3.Ex15" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\int_{0}^{a}\!\!\big(r^{2}-r^{3}(\cos\theta+\sin\theta)+r^{4}\sin\theta\cos\theta\big)dr=\frac{a^{3}}{3}-\frac{\cos\theta+\sin\theta}{4}a^{4}+\frac{\sin\theta\cos\theta}{5}a^{5}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>a</mi></msubsup><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\int_{0}^{a}\!\!\big(r^{2}-r^{3}(\cos\theta+\sin\theta)+r^{4}\sin\theta\cos\theta\big)dr=\frac{a^{3}}{3}-\frac{\cos\theta+\sin\theta}{4}a^{4}+\frac{\sin\theta\cos\theta}{5}a^{5}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p17" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p17.1" class="ltx_p">With <math id="A3.p17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a=\sec\theta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>sec</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a=\sec\theta</annotation></semantics></math> on <math id="A3.p17.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[0,\pi/4]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[0,\pi/4]</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.p17.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a=\csc\theta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>csc</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a=\csc\theta</annotation></semantics></math> on <math id="A3.p17.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[\pi/4,\pi/2]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[\pi/4,\pi/2]</annotation></semantics></math>, we simplify:</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.p18" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A3.Ex16" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex16X"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex16X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle J_{1}(\theta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle J_{1}(\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex16X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{\sec^{3}\theta}{3}-\frac{\cos\theta+\sin\theta}{4}\sec^{4}\theta+\frac{\sin\theta\cos\theta}{5}\sec^{5}\theta=\sec^{3}\theta\!\left(\frac{1}{12}-\frac{1}{20}\tan\theta\right)," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mpadded style="width:0.327em;" width="0.327em"><mi>θ</mi></mpadded><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{\sec^{3}\theta}{3}-\frac{\cos\theta+\sin\theta}{4}\sec^{4}\theta+\frac{\sin\theta\cos\theta}{5}\sec^{5}\theta=\sec^{3}\theta\!\left(\frac{1}{12}-\frac{1}{20}\tan\theta\right),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex16Xa"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex16Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle J_{2}(\theta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle J_{2}(\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex16Xa.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{\csc^{3}\theta}{3}-\frac{\cos\theta+\sin\theta}{4}\csc^{4}\theta+\frac{\sin\theta\cos\theta}{5}\csc^{5}\theta=\csc^{3}\theta\!\left(\frac{1}{12}-\frac{1}{20}\cot\theta\right)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>csc</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msup><mi>csc</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msup><mi>csc</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msup><mi>csc</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mpadded style="width:0.327em;" width="0.327em"><mi>θ</mi></mpadded><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>cot</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{\csc^{3}\theta}{3}-\frac{\cos\theta+\sin\theta}{4}\csc^{4}\theta+\frac{\sin\theta\cos\theta}{5}\csc^{5}\theta=\csc^{3}\theta\!\left(\frac{1}{12}-\frac{1}{20}\cot\theta\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p19" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p19.1" class="ltx_p">Therefore</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.p20" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A3.Ex17" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{E}[R]=4\!\int_{0}^{\pi/4}\!\!\left(\frac{1}{12}\sec^{3}\theta-\frac{1}{20}\sec^{3}\theta\tan\theta\right)d\theta+4\!\int_{\pi/4}^{\pi/2}\!\!\left(\frac{1}{12}\csc^{3}\theta-\frac{1}{20}\csc^{3}\theta\cot\theta\right)d\theta." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.0539em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo lspace="0.0539em" rspace="0em">∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.026em">+</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo lspace="0.026em" rspace="0em">∫</mo><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msup><mi>csc</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msup><mi>csc</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>cot</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}[R]=4\!\int_{0}^{\pi/4}\!\!\left(\frac{1}{12}\sec^{3}\theta-\frac{1}{20}\sec^{3}\theta\tan\theta\right)d\theta+4\!\int_{\pi/4}^{\pi/2}\!\!\left(\frac{1}{12}\csc^{3}\theta-\frac{1}{20}\csc^{3}\theta\cot\theta\right)d\theta.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p21" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p21.1" class="ltx_p">Use the antiderivatives</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.p22" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A3.Ex18" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\int\sec^{3}\theta\,d\theta=\tfrac{1}{2}\big(\sec\theta\tan\theta+\ln(\sec\theta+\tan\theta)\big),\quad\int\sec^{3}\theta\tan\theta\,d\theta=\tfrac{1}{3}\sec^{3}\theta," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mrow><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>sec</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>sec</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.000em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mrow><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\int\sec^{3}\theta\,d\theta=\tfrac{1}{2}\big(\sec\theta\tan\theta+\ln(\sec\theta+\tan\theta)\big),\quad\int\sec^{3}\theta\tan\theta\,d\theta=\tfrac{1}{3}\sec^{3}\theta,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p23" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A3.Ex19" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\int\csc^{3}\theta\,d\theta=\tfrac{1}{2}\big(-\csc\theta\cot\theta+\ln(\csc\theta-\cot\theta)\big),\quad\int\csc^{3}\theta\cot\theta\,d\theta=-\tfrac{1}{3}\csc^{3}\theta," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mrow><msup><mi>csc</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>csc</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>cot</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>csc</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>cot</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.000em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mrow><msup><mi>csc</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>cot</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msup><mi>csc</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\int\csc^{3}\theta\,d\theta=\tfrac{1}{2}\big(-\csc\theta\cot\theta+\ln(\csc\theta-\cot\theta)\big),\quad\int\csc^{3}\theta\cot\theta\,d\theta=-\tfrac{1}{3}\csc^{3}\theta,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p24" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p24.1" class="ltx_p">evaluate at the limits <math id="A3.p24.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta\in\{0,\pi/4,\pi/2\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta\in\{0,\pi/4,\pi/2\}</annotation></semantics></math>, and use <math id="A3.p24.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ln(\sqrt{2}-1)=-\ln(\sqrt{2}+1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">−</mo><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ln(\sqrt{2}-1)=-\ln(\sqrt{2}+1)</annotation></semantics></math>. The two <math id="A3.p24.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>θ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta</annotation></semantics></math>-ranges contribute symmetrically, giving</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.p25" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A3.Ex20" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{E}[R]=\frac{1}{3}\big(\sqrt{2}+\ln(1+\sqrt{2})\big)-\frac{2}{15}\big(2\sqrt{2}-1\big)=\frac{2+\sqrt{2}+5\ln(1+\sqrt{2})}{15}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mn>15</mn></mfrac></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}[R]=\frac{1}{3}\big(\sqrt{2}+\ln(1+\sqrt{2})\big)-\frac{2}{15}\big(2\sqrt{2}-1\big)=\frac{2+\sqrt{2}+5\ln(1+\sqrt{2})}{15}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p26" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p26.1" class="ltx_p">This completes the proof. <math id="A3.p26.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\square" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">□</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\square</annotation></semantics></math></p>
</div>
<div id="A3.p27" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p27.1" class="ltx_p">Remark (application to images). The constant <math id="A3.p27.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mu_{\square}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">□</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu_{\square}</annotation></semantics></math> is the dispersion benchmark for a unit square. For arbitrary image sizes <math id="A3.p27.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(W,H)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(W,H)</annotation></semantics></math>, either (i) anisotropically rescale coordinates to <math id="A3.p27.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[0,1]^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[0,1]^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> before computing distances and compare to <math id="A3.p27.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mu_{\square}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">□</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu_{\square}</annotation></semantics></math>, or (ii) form a per-image Monte-Carlo null by sampling i.i.d. uniform points from <math id="A3.p27.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[0,W]\times[0,H]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[0,W]\times[0,H]</annotation></semantics></math> to estimate the appropriate baseline for that aspect ratio.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>More Experiment Result</h2>

<section id="A4.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.1 </span>distance analysis</h3>

<div id="A4.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">More details of distance analysis results are shown in <a href="#A4.T4" title="In D.1 distance analysis ‣ Appendix D More Experiment Result ‣ Mitigating Coordinate Prediction Bias from Positional Encoding Failures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a></p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>
Comparison of mean pairwise Euclidean distances (diagonal-normalized) across image resolutions on <span id="A4.T4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Screenspot-Pro</span>.
Normal PEs exhibit significantly larger within-input distances, while shuffled PEs lead to much tighter clustering and systematic collapse of coordinate predictions, demonstrating the impact of positional information on spatial diversity.
</figcaption>
